{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/Body_Header_Min.png?t=1742915621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/Header_Explore.png?t=1742915621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Scout</strong> procedural lands that shift beneath your feet.<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Survive</strong> against the fierce barbarian horde.<br>\ud83c\udf86 <strong>Discover</strong> deep systems and powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/Header_Experiment.png?t=1742915621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>Mix</strong> over 200 game-changing technologies.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Improvise</strong> to make the most of each unique run.<br>\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Watch</strong> your choices snowball, creating wildly different civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/Header_Express.png?t=1742915621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Draft</strong> your perfect deck of cards to craft a unique strategy.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Upgrade</strong> your cards, units and cities in every era.<br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Build</strong> an enduring empire, from the stone age to the singularity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/Header_Expire.png?t=1742915621\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"